    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Get started with&nbsp;ready-to-use Python-based web app templates from <a href=\"https://portal.azure.com/#create/PTVS.flasklinux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Flask</u></a>, <a href=\"https://portal.azure.com/#create/PTVS.bottlelinux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Bottle</u></a>, or <a href=\"https://portal.azure.com/#create/PTVS.DjangoLinux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Django</u></a>.&nbsp;They can be&nbsp;customized to build a web app for a small business or a personal web app.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Get started with ready-to-use Python-based web app templates from Flask , Bottle , or Django . They can be customized to build a web app for a small business or a personal web app."
